{"2640660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Scorching Engines", "steam_appid": 2640660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an asteroid plunges Earth into a permanent winter the survival of Humanity's Colony depends on the transportation of a powerful heatcore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a giant experimental vehicle across the frozen wasteland while being protected from the cold by the powerful heatcore inside the vehicle. Gather resources, fight off raiders, and reclaim the vehicle parts the raiders stole. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/856bd62aa2cea3403bfc4aa6f496ab7c.poster.avif?t=1782570028\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/856bd62aa2cea3403bfc4aa6f496ab7c.webm?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/856bd62aa2cea3403bfc4aa6f496ab7c.mp4?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Exploring the world you need to harvest resources to keep the engine running, craft ammunition for your guns, and find upgrades for the vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/e4417cf3e8dc1ff62d6881417ae0df23.poster.avif?t=1782570028\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/e4417cf3e8dc1ff62d6881417ae0df23.webm?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/e4417cf3e8dc1ff62d6881417ae0df23.mp4?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this hostile world you will need to protect both yourself and the vehicle against storms, the cold, and raiders that want the heatcore and vehicle for themselves.<br>Defend it by using turrets onboard your vehicle, guns, or by avoiding the raiders altogether    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/c2fd3084f987a350b7e213f3a43e12fe.poster.avif?t=1782570028\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/c2fd3084f987a350b7e213f3a43e12fe.webm?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/c2fd3084f987a350b7e213f3a43e12fe.mp4?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an asteroid plunges Earth into a permanent winter the survival of Humanity's Colony depends on the transportation of a powerful heatcore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive a giant experimental vehicle across the frozen wasteland while being protected from the cold by the powerful heatcore inside the vehicle. Gather resources, fight off raiders, and reclaim the vehicle parts the raiders stole. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/856bd62aa2cea3403bfc4aa6f496ab7c.poster.avif?t=1782570028\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/856bd62aa2cea3403bfc4aa6f496ab7c.webm?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/856bd62aa2cea3403bfc4aa6f496ab7c.mp4?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Exploring the world you need to harvest resources to keep the engine running, craft ammunition for your guns, and find upgrades for the vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/e4417cf3e8dc1ff62d6881417ae0df23.poster.avif?t=1782570028\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/e4417cf3e8dc1ff62d6881417ae0df23.webm?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/e4417cf3e8dc1ff62d6881417ae0df23.mp4?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this hostile world you will need to protect both yourself and the vehicle against storms, the cold, and raiders that want the heatcore and vehicle for themselves.<br>Defend it by using turrets onboard your vehicle, guns, or by avoiding the raiders altogether    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/c2fd3084f987a350b7e213f3a43e12fe.poster.avif?t=1782570028\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/c2fd3084f987a350b7e213f3a43e12fe.webm?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/extras/c2fd3084f987a350b7e213f3a43e12fe.mp4?t=1782570028\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Scorching Engines is an open-world survival FPS, inspired by Mad Max, and Mortal Engines. Set in a frozen post-apocalyptic world you drive a giant experimental vehicle harvesting resources to keep it fueled and protect it. Explore ruined cities or attack raider camps to find useful resources.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/header.jpg?t=1782570028", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/2700eaf00f5faeda4fa33960f381238360499636/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782570028", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/2700eaf00f5faeda4fa33960f381238360499636/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782570028", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> QuadCore - i5 8300H or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 2GB or similar<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Yes<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Thor Whitemountain"], "publishers": ["Thor Whitemountain"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640660/21b7bc560728f7